- The "·" separator between Living/Healthcare in the new decomposition line
  is presentational; some screen readers render it verbally ("middle dot").
  Not an ACCESSIBILITY.md violation and not blocking, but a candidate for
  `aria-hidden="true"` on the separator glyph alone (not the words around
  it) if the lead wants to tidy verbosity.
